@BookingsService.API_HostAddress = https://localhost:7094

### Listar todas as reservas
GET {{BookingsService.API_HostAddress}}/api/bookings
Accept: application/json

### Buscar reserva por ID
GET {{BookingsService.API_HostAddress}}/api/bookings/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

### Criar reserva (requer JWT)
POST {{BookingsService.API_HostAddress}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "userId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "spaceId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "startDate": "2026-08-01T10:00:00Z",
  "endDate": "2026-08-01T12:00:00Z"
}

### Cancelar reserva (requer JWT)
DELETE {{BookingsService.API_HostAddress}}/api/bookings/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
